Folding phones: unfolded, your section sits on the left and the wheel on the right. Hold a slice to see two sections at once. On Galaxy folds, half-fold it like a laptop or stand it as a tent during a workout for a big rest timer.

Water: tap Undo next to the total to take back a tap, or hold +1 cup to remove your last drink.

Workouts: the target weight now shows what you lifted last time.

